<title>POLAND: Computerland plans no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Computerland plans no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish software firm Computerland SA plans no 1996 dividend and wants to earmark its 1996 net profit of 11.5 million zlotys for reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Computerland's shareholders will vote on the management's proposal on June 6, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
